  caseId: CASE_0147
  caseNumber: 0147
  title: Silence on Harlow Street
  location: Harlow Street, Eastside
  summary: Architect Daniel Reyes was found dead in his office on Harlow Street.
    No forced entry, no alarm. Three people could get in, and one of them is lying.
  briefing: 'Daniel Reyes, 46, co-owner of Reyes & Marlowe Architects, was found
    dead in his office at 23:50 on the night of the 14th.


    The building''s alarm
    was never triggered. Three people had a way in. One of them is lying.'
  initialObjective: Review the case files in the Evidence Room.
  startScene: PoliceStation
  isAvailable: 1
  evidenceTotal: 6
  suspects:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: f074a42f5aec06348bdd8190fbe4c43e, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: fd82df173c88f8141b94b4261c8dc510, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: f1e8a9631610e3d4cba16b732c2167de, type: 2}
  witnesses:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: fd82df173c88f8141b94b4261c8dc510, type: 2}
  crime:
    crimeType: Homicide
    date: Night of the 14th
    timeOfDeath: 21:30 - 22:30 (pathologist's estimate)
    location: Office of Reyes & Marlowe Architects, 3rd floor, 18 Harlow Street
    causeOfDeath: Blunt-force injury to the head
    weapon: Not recovered
    discoveredBy: Nora Hayes, office manager, at 23:50. She called it in at 23:52.
    details: No sign of forced entry and no struggle in the outer office. The building
      alarm never went off.
  victim:
    name: Daniel Reyes
    age: 46
    occupation: Architect, co-owner of Reyes & Marlowe Architects
    background: Founded the practice with Elliot Marlowe eighteen years ago. Known
      for working late and keeping his business close. Divorced, no children.
  timeline:
  - time: 12th
    description: Marlowe learns from Calder Holdings' lawyer that Reyes is selling
      his share of the firm.
    revealedBy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5122687f554ef84589ba61c8d8dd4b5, type: 2}
    isKey: 1
  - time: 17:58
    description: Nora Hayes leaves the office (key card).
    revealedBy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 97dde97aa67e6b044a0aa5ab321077d4, type: 2}
    isKey: 0
  - time: 18:40
    description: Elliot Marlowe leaves the office (key card).
    revealedBy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 97dde97aa67e6b044a0aa5ab321077d4, type: 2}
    isKey: 0
  - time: 19:10
    description: Reyes, working late, arms the building alarm.
    revealedBy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 97dde97aa67e6b044a0aa5ab321077d4, type: 2}
    isKey: 0
  - time: 21:38
    description: The master code opens the lobby door and disarms the alarm. No key
      card is used.
    revealedBy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 97dde97aa67e6b044a0aa5ab321077d4, type: 2}
    isKey: 1
  - time: 21:40
    description: A figure in a long dark coat walks into the lobby and straight to
      the stairs.
    revealedBy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 347dcae623180054694ea33ecc909541, type: 2}
    isKey: 1
  - time: 21:40
    description: Marlowe arrives at the office to see Reyes, by his own admission.
    revealedBy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1dba268f356767242ae9e177b68af55c, type: 2}
    isKey: 1
  - time: 23:47
    description: Hayes's key card opens the lobby door.
    revealedBy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 97dde97aa67e6b044a0aa5ab321077d4, type: 2}
    isKey: 0
  - time: 23:50
    description: Hayes finds Reyes dead at his desk.
    revealedBy: {fileID: 0}
    isKey: 0
  - time: 23:52
    description: Hayes calls the police.
    revealedBy: {fileID: 0}
    isKey: 0
  - time: 00:06
    description: The first officer arrives at the scene.
    revealedBy: {fileID: 0}
    isKey: 0
